 >>[2026-03-26 00:04] taste — the tree should reveal semantic shape at a glance; duplicate names are acceptable if their role is legible.
 >>[2026-03-26 00:05] revise — concepts-tree now expands mixed concept names into explicit topic/lens/intent/anchor subgroup nodes while leaving single-kind concepts flat.
 >>[2026-03-26 00:06] observe — `npm --prefix extensions/vscode-spw run compile` and `git diff --check` both pass after the tree refactor.
}

